  "description": "The target community is individuals who have experienced the physical discomfort of chopping onions, which causes eye irritation due to sulfur compounds. This includes anyone who has performed this common kitchen task and can relate to the exaggerated facial expression and hand gesture used to convey the sensation. The meme is designed to resonate with a broad, universal audience, particularly those familiar with home cooking or food preparation, as it taps into a shared, relatable, and mildly unpleasant experience.",
